WEBVTT

00:00:12.002 --> 00:00:14.684
<v><b>Presenter:</b></v> OK. It begins with <i>B</i>.

00:00:15.388 --> 00:00:19.416
It’s an adjective for a man who has no hair on his head!

00:00:20.991 --> 00:00:21.754
<v><b>Victoria:</b></v> Bald.

00:00:22.230 --> 00:00:22.949
<v><b>Presenter:</b></v> Right.

00:00:27.579 --> 00:00:29.252
It begins with <i>C</i>.

00:00:29.735 --> 00:00:31.142
It’s an adjective.

00:00:31.688 --> 00:00:34.876
It describes a place where there are a lot of people,

00:00:35.168 --> 00:00:38.694
for example a restaurant or a beach in the summer.

00:00:40.307 --> 00:00:41.220
<v><b>Victoria:</b></v> Crowded.

00:00:41.518 --> 00:00:42.183
<v><b>Presenter:</b></v> Right.

00:00:45.428 --> 00:00:47.024
It begins with <i>G</i>.

00:00:47.826 --> 00:00:50.791
They’re things which people wear on their hands.

00:00:51.227 --> 00:00:51.965
<v><b>Victoria:</b></v> Gloves.

00:00:52.335 --> 00:00:53.057
<v><b>Presenter:</b></v> Right.

00:00:56.239 --> 00:00:57.647
It begins with <i>K</i>.

00:00:58.492 --> 00:01:00.566
It’s the room where people cook.

00:01:00.803 --> 00:01:01.599
<v><b>Victoria:</b></v> Kitchen.

00:01:01.863 --> 00:01:02.442
<v><b>Presenter:</b></v> Right.

00:01:06.227 --> 00:01:07.633
It begins with <i>L</i>.

00:01:08.269 --> 00:01:14.265
It’s an adjective for someone who doesn’t like studying or working, for example.

00:01:14.968 --> 00:01:17.156
It’s the opposite of <i>hard-working</i>.

00:01:18.069 --> 00:01:19.101
<v><b>Victoria:</b></v> Lazy.

00:01:19.251 --> 00:01:20.087
<v><b>Presenter:</b></v> Right.

00:01:22.852 --> 00:01:24.396
It begins with <i>T</i>.

00:01:25.109 --> 00:01:29.981
It’s a thing which you use in an airport to help you with your cases,

00:01:30.156 --> 00:01:33.335
or in a supermarket to put your shopping in…

00:01:36.176 --> 00:01:37.789
Just three seconds left…

00:01:38.521 --> 00:01:39.401
<v><b>Victoria:</b></v> Trolley!

00:01:40.700 --> 00:01:43.256
<v><b>Presenter:</b></v> Congratulations, Victoria! You’ve done it!

00:01:43.256 --> 00:01:44.556
<v><b>Victoria:</b></v> Oh, great!